  {
    "type": "post",
    "id": "7460666355940257793",
    "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/stuart-hardman_waterproof-mobile-phones-mobile-apps-and-activity-7460666355940257793-U5O7",
    "content": "Waterproof mobile phones, mobile apps and cloud software are BRILLIANT!\n\nI’ve done something really nasty to my back this week that has left me pretty much incapacitated, even breathing hurts and that’s a fairly important thing to be doing regularly.\n\nI’ve discovered the only thing that actually relieves the pain is lying in a hot bath with the Whirlpool on (humble brag). Unfortunately, traditionally it’s not a great place to work. Until I realised I could do nearly everything I wanted to do on my phone:\n\n✔️ Emails\n✔️ Payment runs in Business Central using Yavrio\n✔️ Teams chats\n✔️ Copilot \n✔️ Microsoft 365 apps\n✔️ Arranging meetings – not attending them (that would be a step too far!!)\n\nI’ve often said in conversations with prospects that the nice thing about cloud Business Central that you can use it anywhere you need to, even on the beach if you need to check something on holiday. Add in the bath to that as well!\n\nDanny knows...",
